  (text "F1 + D1: if the supply is connected backwards, D1 conducts and blows F1 (the fuse comes before\nthe main switch, so this works with the switch off too). J2 goes to the illuminated rocker switch;\nwithout a switch, link J2 pins 1 and 2. U1: the ESP32-C3 Wi-Fi peaks take the 5 V load to about\n0.5 A. Use a pin-compatible switching regulator (R-78E5.0-1.0), or an L7805 on a heatsink." (at 20.32 102.87 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 9e5d1606-0ebd-552f-b7a5-14dbbbd9ea65)
  )
  (text "VALVE DRIVER (high-side P-MOSFET) AND VALVE / FLOW SENSOR TERMINAL" (at 20.32 119.38 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom))
